      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>渴望吧，渴望多少，就毫无保留地摄取多少。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_2",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>披上吧，然后毫不吝惜地吞噬吧。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_3",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>渴望吧，如你所愿地，毫不犹豫地将其耗尽。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_4",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>渴望吧。如此，便会披覆于身。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_1",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>纵能填满，亦不填满。纵能享用，亦当止息。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_2",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>勿使盈溢，依序而行。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_3",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>勿违纪律。西西弗铭记你们所忍受的所有痛苦。</color>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
